OL,3,GNEWSANewlywed 'could recount every
OL,4,Asecond' of fatal crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt had been an "fabulous" Saturday
OL,7,Fnight for newlyweds George and Tom
OL,8,FDaniels.
OL,10,FThe couple had just got into an Uber
OL,11,Fwith two friends, Emily Rushton and
OL,12,FDanny Carroll, after spending the
OL,13,Fevening at a 30th birthday party in
OL,14,FBolton, Greater Manchester.
OL,16,FTen minutes later, a car travelling at
OL,17,Fmore than 100mph in a 30mph zone
OL,18,Fsmashed head on into their taxi.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
